  "reasoning": "The facts describe two distinct illegal actions: (1) the defendant deliberately failed to declare and pay taxes on a large amount of coal sales, resulting in a substantial tax evasion amount (逃税). This meets the elements of the crime of tax evasion under the Criminal Law. (2) The defendant also fabricated and used false VAT special invoices, both completely fabricated (伪造) and \"认证后失控\" invoices, to claim input tax deductions. This constitutes the crime of falsifying (虚开) special VAT invoices. Both offenses are separate crimes and must be charged together. No other crimes are indicated in the facts.",
